###✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨
# VARIABLES GLOBALES

@protocol = https
@hostname = jsonplaceholder.typicode.com
@port = 443
@host = {{protocol}}://{{hostname}}:{{port}}
@contentType = application/json

###✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨
# OBTENER TODOS LOS ATRIBUTOS DEL RECURSO

@post = posts/1

GET {{host}}/{{post}} HTTP/1.1

###✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨✨
# CREAR LOS ATRIBUTOS DEL RECURSO

@post = posts

POST {{host}}/{{post}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "userId": 1,
    "title": "ejemplo",
    "body": "ejemplo"
}



